# "Existing damage prevention shields won't be reduced by damage that can't be prevented" (CR 615.12). Bot1 puts Healing
# Salve's shield of 3 on itself; Bot2's Questing Beast (haste) attacks, and its combat damage can't be prevented: Bot1
# takes all 4, and the shield is left whole. After combat Bot2's Lightning Bolt at Bot1 is prevented in full by it. Bot1
# ends at 16; had the Beast's damage used the shield up, the Bolt would leave Bot1 at 13.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Healing Salve
Island x25

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Questing Beast
Lightning Bolt
Island x22

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Questing Beast.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Healing Salve.Cast
Bot1.Modes(Prevent the next 3 damage)
Bot1.Target(Bot1)
[T2 Bot2.DeclareAttackers]
Bot2.Attack(Questing Beast > Bot1)
[T2 Bot2.Main2]
? Bot1.Life = 16
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1)
[T2 Bot2.End]

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 16
Bot2.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt; Black Lotus
Prevented = 3 Lightning Bolt > Bot1 by Healing Salve
